{"seq":2,"slug":"pods-and-deployments","title":"Pod 与 Deployment","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/kubernetes-essentials/pods-and-deployments","wordCount":882,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"pod-与-deployment\">Pod 与 Deployment</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>Pod</strong> 是 Kubernetes 最小的可部署单元，一个 Pod 内的多个容器共享网络命名空间（同一 IP）与存储卷，并始终被调度到同一节点。</p>\n<p>在 Pod 之上有两个管理概念：<strong>Deployment</strong> 通过 ReplicaSet 维护指定数量的 Pod 副本，提供声明式的滚动更新与回滚；<strong>探针（Probe）</strong> 分为 liveness、readiness、startup，分别决定是否重启容器、是否将 Pod 接入流量、是否等待启动完成。<code>requests</code> 与 <code>limits</code> 则决定调度依据与资源上限。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"pod-基础\">Pod 基础</h2><p>Pod 是 Kubernetes 中最小的可部署单元。一个 Pod 封装了一个或多个紧密关联的容器，它们共享网络命名空间（同一 IP 地址）和存储卷。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: v1&#10;kind: Pod&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: my-app&#10;  labels:&#10;    app: my-app&#10;    version: v1&#10;spec:&#10;  containers:&#10;    - name: app&#10;      image: myapp:1.0.0&#10;      ports:&#10;        - containerPort: 3000&#10;      resources:&#10;        requests:&#10;          cpu: &#39;100m&#39;&#10;          memory: &#39;128Mi&#39;&#10;        limits:&#10;          cpu: &#39;500m&#39;&#10;          memory: &#39;512Mi&#39;&#10;      livenessProbe:&#10;        httpGet:&#10;          path: /health&#10;          port: 3000&#10;        initialDelaySeconds: 15&#10;        periodSeconds: 10&#10;      readinessProbe:&#10;        httpGet:&#10;          path: /ready&#10;          port: 3000&#10;        initialDelaySeconds: 5&#10;        periodSeconds: 5\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Pod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  containers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">myapp:1.0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">containerPort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      resources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        requests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          cpu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'100m'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'128Mi'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        limits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          cpu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'500m'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'512Mi'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      livenessProbe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        httpGet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/health</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          port</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        initialDelaySeconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        periodSeconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      readinessProbe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        httpGet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/ready</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          port</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        initialDelaySeconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        periodSeconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph Pod&#10;        NET[共享网络&lt;br/&gt;同一 IP]&#10;        C1[容器 1&lt;br/&gt;应用进程]&#10;        C2[容器 2&lt;br/&gt;Sidecar]&#10;        VOL[(共享 Volume)]&#10;        C1 --&gt; NET&#10;        C2 --&gt; NET&#10;        C1 --&gt; VOL&#10;        C2 --&gt; VOL&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph Pod\n        NET[共享网络&lt;br/&gt;同一 IP]\n        C1[容器 1&lt;br/&gt;应用进程]\n        C2[容器 2&lt;br/&gt;Sidecar]\n        VOL[(共享 Volume)]\n        C1 --&gt; NET\n        C2 --&gt; NET\n        C1 --&gt; VOL\n        C2 --&gt; VOL\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Pod 特性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>共享网络</td>\n<td>同一 Pod 内容器共享 IP 和端口空间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>共享存储</td>\n<td>可声明共享 Volume</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>共同调度</td>\n<td>同一 Pod 的容器运行在同一节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生命周期绑定</td>\n<td>Pod 内所有容器同时启动和停止</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"pod-生命周期\">Pod 生命周期</h2><p>Pod 从创建到终止经历多个阶段，理解这些阶段对于排查问题至关重要。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    P[Pending] --&gt; R[Running]&#10;    R --&gt; S[Succeeded]&#10;    R --&gt; F[Failed]&#10;    P --&gt; F&#10;    R --&gt;|删除| T[Terminating]\">graph LR\n    P[Pending] --&gt; R[Running]\n    R --&gt; S[Succeeded]\n    R --&gt; F[Failed]\n    P --&gt; F\n    R --&gt;|删除| T[Terminating]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"kubectl get pod my-app -o jsonpath=&#39;{.status.phase}&#39;&#10;&#10;kubectl describe pod my-app&#10;&#10;kubectl get events --field-selector involvedObject.name=my-app\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pod</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-app</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> jsonpath='{.status.phase}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> describe</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pod</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> events</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --field-selector</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> involvedObject.name=my-app</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>常见原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Pending</td>\n<td>等待调度或拉取镜像</td>\n<td>资源不足、镜像拉取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Running</td>\n<td>至少一个容器在运行</td>\n<td>正常状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Succeeded</td>\n<td>所有容器成功退出</td>\n<td>Job 完成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Failed</td>\n<td>至少一个容器非零退出</td>\n<td>应用错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Unknown</td>\n<td>无法获取 Pod 状态</td>\n<td>节点通信异常</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"容器探针\">容器探针</h3><p>Kubernetes 通过三种探针监控容器健康状态：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>探针类型</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>失败后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>livenessProbe</td>\n<td>检测容器是否存活</td>\n<td>重启容器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>readinessProbe</td>\n<td>检测容器是否就绪接收流量</td>\n<td>从 Service 端点移除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>startupProbe</td>\n<td>检测容器是否启动完成</td>\n<td>暂停其他探针检测</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"spec:&#10;  containers:&#10;    - name: app&#10;      startupProbe:&#10;        httpGet:&#10;          path: /health&#10;          port: 3000&#10;        failureThreshold: 30&#10;        periodSeconds: 10&#10;      livenessProbe:&#10;        httpGet:&#10;          path: /health&#10;          port: 3000&#10;        periodSeconds: 10&#10;        failureThreshold: 3&#10;      readinessProbe:&#10;        httpGet:&#10;          path: /ready&#10;          port: 3000&#10;        periodSeconds: 5&#10;        failureThreshold: 2\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  containers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      startupProbe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        httpGet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/health</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          port</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        failureThreshold</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        periodSeconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      livenessProbe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        httpGet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/health</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          port</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        periodSeconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        failureThreshold</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      readinessProbe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        httpGet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/ready</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          port</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        periodSeconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        failureThreshold</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>startupProbe</code> 在容器启动完成前会阻止 livenessProbe 和 readinessProbe 的执行。对于启动较慢的应用（如 Java），使用 startupProbe 可以避免在启动阶段被 livenessProbe 误杀。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"deployment-资源\">Deployment 资源</h2><p>Deployment 是管理 Pod 副本集的高级控制器。它通过 ReplicaSet 维护指定数量的 Pod 副本，并支持声明式的滚动更新和回滚。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: apps/v1&#10;kind: Deployment&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: api-server&#10;  labels:&#10;    app: api-server&#10;spec:&#10;  replicas: 3&#10;  selector:&#10;    matchLabels:&#10;      app: api-server&#10;  strategy:&#10;    type: RollingUpdate&#10;    rollingUpdate:&#10;      maxSurge: 1&#10;      maxUnavailable: 0&#10;  template:&#10;    metadata:&#10;      labels:&#10;        app: api-server&#10;    spec:&#10;      containers:&#10;        - name: api&#10;          image: myapi:1.2.3&#10;          ports:&#10;            - containerPort: 3000&#10;          resources:&#10;            requests:&#10;              cpu: &#39;200m&#39;&#10;              memory: &#39;256Mi&#39;&#10;            limits:&#10;              cpu: &#39;1000m&#39;&#10;              memory: &#39;1Gi&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">apps/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Deployment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">api-server</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">api-server</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89