an></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              cpu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'200m'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'256Mi'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            limits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              cpu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1000m'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1Gi'</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    DEP[Deployment&lt;br/&gt;api-server] --&gt; RS[ReplicaSet&lt;br/&gt;api-server-abc123]&#10;    RS --&gt; POD1[Pod 1]&#10;    RS --&gt; POD2[Pod 2]&#10;    RS --&gt; POD3[Pod 3]\">graph TD\n    DEP[Deployment&lt;br/&gt;api-server] --&gt; RS[ReplicaSet&lt;br/&gt;api-server-abc123]\n    RS --&gt; POD1[Pod 1]\n    RS --&gt; POD2[Pod 2]\n    RS --&gt; POD3[Pod 3]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"kubectl apply -f deployment.yaml&#10;&#10;kubectl get deployment api-server&#10;&#10;kubectl scale deployment api-server --replicas=5&#10;&#10;kubectl rollout status deployment api-server\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> apply</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deployment.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deployment</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> api-server</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> scale</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deployment</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> api-server</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --replicas=5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rollout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deployment</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> api-server</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"滚动更新与回滚\">滚动更新与回滚</h2><p>Deployment 的滚动更新策略确保应用更新过程中始终有可用实例服务请求。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"kubectl set image deployment/api-server api=myapi:1.3.0&#10;&#10;kubectl rollout status deployment/api-server&#10;&#10;kubectl rollout history deployment/api-server&#10;&#10;kubectl rollout undo deployment/api-server&#10;&#10;kubectl rollout undo deployment/api-server --to-revision=2\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> set</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> image</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deployment/api-server</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> api=myapi:1.3.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rollout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deployment/api-server</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rollout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> history</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deployment/api-server</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rollout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> undo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deployment/api-server</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rollout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> undo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deployment/api-server</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --to-revision=2</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 滚动更新过程&#10;        RS1[旧 ReplicaSet&lt;br/&gt;v1.2.3]&#10;        RS2[新 ReplicaSet&lt;br/&gt;v1.3.0]&#10;        RS1 --&gt;|缩减| S1[3→2→1→0]&#10;        RS2 --&gt;|扩展| S2[0→1→2→3]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 滚动更新过程\n        RS1[旧 ReplicaSet&lt;br/&gt;v1.2.3]\n        RS2[新 ReplicaSet&lt;br/&gt;v1.3.0]\n        RS1 --&gt;|缩减| S1[3→2→1→0]\n        RS2 --&gt;|扩展| S2[0→1→2→3]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>更新策略参数</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>推荐值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>maxSurge</td>\n<td>超出期望副本数的最大 Pod 数</td>\n<td>1 或 25%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>maxUnavailable</td>\n<td>更新期间不可用的最大 Pod 数</td>\n<td>0 或 25%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>minReadySeconds</td>\n<td>Pod 就绪后等待时间</td>\n<td>10-30s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>revisionHistoryLimit</td>\n<td>保留的旧 ReplicaSet 数量</td>\n<td>10</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 设置 <code>maxUnavailable: 0</code> 和 <code>maxSurge: 1</code> 可以实现零停机滚动更新——在新 Pod 就绪之前不会终止旧 Pod。但这需要额外的集群资源来运行临时多出的 Pod。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"资源管理\">资源管理</h2><p>合理的资源请求（requests）和限制（limits）是集群稳定运行的关键。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"spec:&#10;  containers:&#10;    - name: app&#10;      resources:&#10;        requests:&#10;          cpu: &#39;200m&#39;&#10;          memory: &#39;256Mi&#39;&#10;        limits:&#10;          cpu: &#39;1000m&#39;&#10;          memory: &#39;1Gi&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  containers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      resources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        requests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          cpu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'200m'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'256Mi'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        limits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          cpu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1000m'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1Gi'</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>资源配置</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>不设置的后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>requests</td>\n<td>调度器分配节点的依据</td>\n<td>无法保证资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>limits</td>\n<td>容器可使用的资源上限</td>\n<td>可能耗尽节点资源</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"kubectl top pods&#10;&#10;kubectl top nodes&#10;&#10;kubectl describe node &lt;node-name&gt; | grep -A 5 &quot;Allocated resources&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> top</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pods</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> top</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nodes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> describe</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">node-nam</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">e</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -A</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Allocated resources\"</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((Pod 与 Deployment))&#10;    Pod&#10;      最小部署单元&#10;      共享网络和存储&#10;      容器探针&#10;    生命周期&#10;      Pending&#10;      Running&#10;      Succeeded/Failed&#10;    Deployment&#10;      副本管理&#10;      ReplicaSet&#10;      声明式配置&#10;    滚动更新&#10;      maxSurge&#10;      maxUnavailable&#10;      回滚能力&#10;    资源管理&#10;      requests 请求&#10;      limits 限制&#10;      QoS 等级\">mindmap\n  root((Pod 与 Deployment))\n    Pod\n      最小部署单元\n      共享网络和存储\n      容器探针\n    生命周期\n      Pending\n      Running\n      Succeeded/Failed\n    Deployment\n      副本管理\n      ReplicaSet\n      声明式配置\n    滚动更新\n      maxSurge\n      maxUnavailable\n      回滚能力\n    资源管理\n      requests 请求\n      limits 限制\n      QoS 等级</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>Pod</strong> 是 Kubernetes 最小部署单元，同一 Pod 内容器共享网络和存储。</li>\n<li>三种探针（liveness、readiness、startup）协同监控容器健康，确保只有就绪的 Pod 接收流量。</li>\n<li><strong>Deployment</strong> 通过 ReplicaSet 管理 Pod 副本，支持声明式的滚动更新和一键回滚。</li>\n<li>滚动更新通过 <code>maxSurge</code> 和 <code>maxUnavailable</code> 控制更新节奏，<code>maxUnavailable: 0</code> 实现零停机更新。</li>\n<li>合理配置 <code>requests</code> 和 <code>limits</code> 确保调度器做出正确决策，防止资源争抢。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Pod 与 Deployment","id":"pod-与-deployment"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Pod 基础","id":"pod-基础"},{"level":2,"text":"Pod 生命周期","id":"pod-生命周期"},{"level":3,"text":"容器探针","id":"容器探针"},{"level":2,"text":"Deployment 资源","id":"deployment-资源"},{"level":2,"text":"滚动更新与回滚","id":"滚动更新与回滚"},{"level":2,"text":"资源管理","id":"资源管理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"架构与概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/kubernetes-essentials/architecture-and-concepts"},"next":{"title":"Service 与 Ingress","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/kubernetes-essentials/services-and-ingress"}}